{
  "title": "🌍 Word Problems — Quadratic Equations in Real Life",
  "hook": "A train travels 360 km at a certain speed. If the speed were 5 km/h more, the journey would take 1 hour less. What's the speed? This turns into a quadratic equation — and these problems are some of the most rewarding to solve!",
  "explanation": "<p><b>Strategy:</b></p><div style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">1</div><div><strong>Identify the unknown</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">What are we finding? Let it be x.</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">2</div><div><strong>Form the equation</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">Translate the word problem into a quadratic equation.</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">3</div><div><strong>Solve the quadratic</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">Use factorization or the quadratic formula.</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">4</div><div><strong>Reject invalid roots</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">Negative lengths, speeds, or ages don't make sense!</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">5</div><div><strong>Verify</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">Check the answer in the original words of the problem.</span></div></div></div><br><b>Common setups:</b><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;font-size:0.88rem\"><tr><th style=\"background:#E3F2FD;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #BBDEFB;text-align:left;font-weight:700\">Type</th><th style=\"background:#E3F2FD;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #BBDEFB;text-align:left;font-weight:700\">Setup</th><th style=\"background:#E3F2FD;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #BBDEFB;text-align:left;font-weight:700\">Resulting equation</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Consecutive numbers</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">x(x+1) = N</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">x² + x − N = 0</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Speed problems</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">360/x − 360/(x+5) = 1</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Simplifies to quadratic</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Area problems</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">x(x+3) = A</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">x² + 3x − A = 0</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Work problems</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">1/x + 1/(x+5) = 1/6</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #E0E0E0\">Simplifies to quadratic</td></tr></table><div style=\"background:#FFF3E0;border-left:4px solid #E65100;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;margin:10px 0;font-size:0.88rem\">⚠️ <strong>Tip:</strong> Always check: Does the answer make physical sense? Negative speed or negative age should be rejected.</div>",
  "worked_example": "<b>Example:</b> A train travels 480 km. If the speed were 8 km/h less, the journey would take 3 hours more. Find the speed.<br><br><div style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">1</div><div><strong>Let speed = x km/h</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">Time = 480/x hours</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">2</div><div><strong>Reduced speed scenario</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">Speed = (x−8), Time = 480/(x−8) hours</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">3</div><div><strong>Condition</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">480/(x−8) − 480/x = 3</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">4</div><div><strong>Simplify</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">480x − 480(x−8) = 3x(x−8) → 3840 = 3x² − 24x</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">5</div><div><strong>Standard form</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">x² − 8x − 1280 = 0 → (x−40)(x+32) = 0</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"min-width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#4A90D9;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:0.85rem\">6</div><div><strong>Answer</strong><br><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:0.88rem\">x = 40 (reject −32). Speed = 40 km/h</span></div></div></div><p>Verify: Time at 40 = 12h. Time at 32 = 15h. Difference = 3h ✓</p>",
